// The templates of the model's user-facing messages (mitcad#1284,
// docs/translations.md "The model's messages"): every message text of the
// Rust sources of core/, found by `mitcad-translations messages`, with its
// values as %1, %2, ... Generated, do not edit: the target
// update_translations writes it again (tools/translations-update.cmake),
// and the ctest repo.model-messages fails while it differs from the sources.
